{"id":"0c6ab22ce202551d","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-bernstein.md","title":"Existence of Bernstein Sets","display":"thm-bernstein — Existence of Bernstein Sets","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-bernstein","aliases":["58-thm-bernstein"],"display":"thm-bernstein — Existence of Bernstein Sets","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-bernstein"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-bernstein</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bernstein — Existence of Bernstein Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"42d80f2fd93c2116\" href=\"?note=42d80f2fd93c2116\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> is the usual topology and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c=|\\mathbb R|\">\\(\\mathfrak c=|\\mathbb R|\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BernsteinSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BernsteinSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bernstein\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BernsteinSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb R\n\\land\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(P,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land P\\neq\\emptyset\n\\to\n(P\\cap A\\neq\\emptyset\\land P\\setminus A\\neq\\emptyset)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bernstein\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BernsteinSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb R\n\\land\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(P,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land P\\neq\\emptyset\n\\to\n(P\\cap A\\neq\\emptyset\\land P\\setminus A\\neq\\emptyset)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bernstein}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{BernsteinSet}_S(A)\\land|A|=\\mathfrak c\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bernstein}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{BernsteinSet}_S(A)\\land|A|=\\mathfrak c\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The construction enumerates all nonempty perfect subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> and recursively chooses one point for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and one for its complement.</li>\n<li>A Bernstein set has neither the perfect-set property, Lebesgue measurability, nor the property of Baire.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel.md","status":"resolved","id":"42d80f2fd93c2116","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-perfect-kernel.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c=|\\mathbb R|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BernsteinSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bernstein\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BernsteinSet}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb R\n\\land\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{PerfectIn}_S(P,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land P\\neq\\emptyset\n\\to\n(P\\cap A\\neq\\emptyset\\land P\\setminus A\\neq\\emptyset)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bernstein}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{BernsteinSet}_S(A)\\land|A|=\\mathfrak c\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1195,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4044","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-bernstein.md|58-thm-bernstein]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["42d80f2fd93c2116"]}